2026-08-25T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-1053) 'OpenUSD as the internal format
 # uuid: 120bec07-33ea-533b-88e7-9246b5a39757
 # tags: rfd:title, rfd:flight-level:l2, rfd:attest-in:none
 RFD:Committed  1 RFD
 Serials:Weftspun

2026-08-25T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-1053) 'asset interchange
 # tags: rfd:feature, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-1053) 'OpenUSD is the working format, and glTF and VRM stay at the edge.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-1053) 'Each pipeline stage reads a GLB and writes a GLB. A rig stage rewrites the whole file to add bones, a texture stage rewrites it again, and when a mesh is wrong no record says which stage made it wrong.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-1053) 'Convert to glTF or VRM at the boundary only, and check that each model image's `predict()` returns the USD layer as well as the transmission file.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-1053) 'OpenUSD as the internal format
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-1053) 'OpenUSD is the internal format. Every stage reads a stage and writes a layer. glTF, VRM, and KHR avatar stay the transmission formats, and the pipeline converts to them at the edge.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-1053) 'Committed 2026-09-02: CLAUDE.md ratifies the choice as a hard constraint (OpenUSD `.usda` for text-editable, ZStandard parquet for bulk; zip and gzip banned; usdz exempt). RFD66606-2169 abandoned the Elixir studio core; the `fabric-stage-runtime` Hex package still ships OpenUSD to every consumer.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-1053) 'RFD66606-1036 gives the model image convention. `fabric-stage-runtime` (Hex) links this runtime to every stage. RFD66606-1002 records the pipeline stages that become layers.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-1053) 'Why layers, and not a better mesh format
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-1053) 'USD is to this pipeline what `.blend` is to Blender. It is the working file, and it never reaches a browser.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-1053) 'USD composes. A stage adds a sublayer with its own opinion, and the layer below stays intact and readable.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-1053) '| Stage        | Writes                                |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-1053) '| ------------ | ------------------------------------- |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-1053) '| image to 3D  | the base mesh layer                   |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-1053) '| retopology   | a layer that overrides the mesh       |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-1053) '| UV unwrap    | a layer that adds the primvar         |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-1053) '| segmentation | a layer of part scopes                |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-1053) '| rig          | a layer of skeleton and skin bindings |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-1053) '| texture      | a layer of material bindings          |
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-1053) 'A caller may then mute the retopology layer and see the original. That is not possible in a flat file.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-1053) 'The boundary
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1053  1 LINE
 Text:Written

